WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.968
A few settings make Arus feel right on your PC.

2
00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:07.830
Under Appearance, pick a dark or light theme, your language, and row density.

3
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.672
Choose what's most comfortable for your eyes.

4
00:00:10.672 --> 00:00:16.671
Under Behaviour, turn on launch at login, clipboard watching, notifications, and the tray icon.

5
00:00:16.671 --> 00:00:20.965
That keeps Arus ready in the background without getting in your way.

6
00:00:20.965 --> 00:00:25.259
Under Downloads, set the main folder, connection count, and retries.

7
00:00:25.259 --> 00:00:29.174
The right connection count can balance speed and network load.

8
00:00:29.174 --> 00:00:32.142
Arus also checks for updates in the background.

9
00:00:32.142 --> 00:00:36.562
Open the About tab and click Check now to look for the latest version.

10
00:00:36.562 --> 00:00:40.856
If an update is available, you can download it right inside the app.

11
00:00:40.856 --> 00:00:45.023
You can change these settings at any time without restarting Arus.

12
00:00:45.023 --> 00:00:48.686
Every setting saves automatically and applies immediately.

13
00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:52.285
That way, Arus feels like an app built around your needs.

14
00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:56.137
So Arus adapts to the way you work, not the other way around.

